<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports-November 20.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports-November 20.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights may be postponed at airports in Russia's Northern Caucasus and mid-Volga region on November 21 due to thick fog in the morning, the Russian Weather Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
